msgid "　『プロイキッシャー：個別』にしましょう。"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ2:1894:19910: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1894
msgctxt "text_id=19910 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　それじゃロビン、お店の予約をしておいて。"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ2:1894:19911: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1894
msgctxt "text_id=19911 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　それが済んだらチョコレイトの湯煎。"
