#. Occurrence NZ2:1894:19912: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ2_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1894
msgctxt "text_id=19912 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　それが済んだら鏡の<磨|みが>き。"
