#. Occurrence NZ2:1959:19915: voice_id=BA0_NZ2_0029; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=NZ2
#: NZ2:1959
msgctxt "text_id=19915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "　　いつも通りってコトッスね！"
