#. Occurrence NZ4:1350:20201: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ4_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ4
#: NZ4:1350
msgctxt "text_id=20201 | speaker=alice"
msgid "　　殺された<駒鳥|ロビン>を巡ってのお話。"
